---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="A short version of who I am.">
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="kicker mono">about</p>
    <h1>I write software that runs on phones, in browsers, and lately, in loops.</h1>
    <p>
      I'm a software engineer based in Goa, India. Most of my career has been in iOS — Swift, SwiftUI,
      the long, quiet hours of getting an animation to feel <em>right</em>. The web shows up when it has to,
      and increasingly, so do agents.
    </p>
    <p>
      I learn by building. Most of what I know came from documentation, source code, and the small humiliations
      of shipping. The projects I love most are the ones with sparse docs — that's where you find out who you are.
    </p>
    <p>
      I have opinions about animation curves, semicolons, and whether "engineer" is a job title or a posture.
      I'm currently employed and not looking for work. This site is just a place to keep the receipts.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
      For the curious: <a class="link" href="/colophon">colophon</a>,
      <a class="link" href="/cv.pdf" download>CV</a>,
      <a class="link" href="https://github.com/joshuacardozo1994" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.1rem; }
  .prose h1 { max-width: 22ch; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  .kicker {
    font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--fg-faint); margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .prose p { font-size: 1.03rem; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
